# ---------------------------------------------------------------- heavy, never versioned
# datasets (1.4 GB of images and prompt files; copied to the box separately).
# The trailing name has changed once already and the old rule stopped matching,
# which put every WMDP prompt file into a commit; match the prefix instead.
VLM V-Lens Final Dataset*/
data/
data_root/
# earlier runs, kept on disk for reference and never versioned
archive_*/
/.plotsync/
# everything the experiments write, and the built pages. Anchored to the root:
# an unanchored figures/ also matched vlens/figures/, so the module that draws
# every figure was never once committed.
/paper/
/figures.bak*/
/logs/
# the vendored reference implementation (cloned on each machine)
ref_jlens_repo/
# model and cache files
*.npz
*.npy
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.bin
*.h5
*.parquet
*.pkl
*.pickle
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
# images and media outside the code
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
*.gif
*.mp4
*.pdf
# fonts are small but binary; the build embeds them from assets/, kept
!assets/*.otf
!assets/*.b64

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- notes and manuscripts: only the root README is kept
*.md
!/README.md
*.tex
*.bib
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.bbl
*.blg
*.toc
*.synctex.gz
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk

